trol-soft text-petrol\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-route h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"19\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M9 19h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-11a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H15\"></path><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-bold text-ink\">Radari uz maršruta</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2\">Pirms brauciena redzi, cik stacionāro, vidējā ātruma un mobilo radaru ir ceļā — un vari izvēlēties citu maršrutu.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-card p-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-petrol-soft text-petrol\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-volume-2 h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z\"></path><path d=\"M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6\"></path><path d=\"M19.364 18.364a9 9 0 0 0 0-12.728\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-bold text-ink\">Balss un skaņas brīdinājumi</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2\">Norādes pagriezieniem un brīdinājums ~600 un 200 m pirms radara. Ātruma pārsniegšanas signāls.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-card p-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-petrol-soft text-petrol\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-box h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z\"></path><path d=\"m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-bold text-ink\">3D karte, kas griežas</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2\">Kā īstā navigācijā — karte griežas līdzi braukšanas virzienam, ēkas 3D, plūdena kustība.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-card p-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-petrol-soft text-petrol\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-fuel h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 13h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2a2 2 0 0 0 4 0v-6.998a2 2 0 0 0-.59-1.42L18 5\"></path><path d=\"M14 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"></path><path d=\"M2 21h13\"></path><path d=\"M3 9h11\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-bold text-ink\">Viss vajadzīgais kartē</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2\">Degvielas un gāzes (LPG/CNG) uzpildes, EV uzlāde, maksas un bezmaksas stāvvietas, veikali, aptiekas, iestādes un autoservisi visā Latvijā.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-card p-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-petrol-soft text-petrol\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-bold text-ink\">Bez reģistrācijas</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2\">Bezmaksas, bez lietotnes lejupielādes. Atrašanās vieta netiek glabāta mūsu serverī.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div><h2 class=\"display-md text-2xl text-ink\">Kā lietot</h2><ol class=\"mt-5 space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-4\"><span class=\"num grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-night text-sm font-black text-white\">1</span><span class=\"pt-1.5 text-ink-2\">Nospied „Sākt navigāciju” un atļauj atrašanās vietu.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-4\"><span class=\"num grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-night text-sm font-black text-white\">2</span><span class=\"pt-1.5 text-ink-2\">Ieraksti galamērķi vai izvēlies Tavs Auto autoplaci.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-4\"><span class=\"num grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-night text-sm font-black text-white\">3</span><span class=\"pt-1.5 text-ink-2\">Izvēlies maršrutu — redzēsi laiku, attālumu un radarus.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-4\"><span class=\"num grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-night text-sm font-black text-white\">4</span><span class=\"pt-1.5 text-ink-2\">Novieto telefonu turētājā un brauc — par pārējo parūpēsimies.</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] bg-night p-7 text-white\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-signal\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-smartphone h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg> Padoms</p><h3 class=\"display-md mt-2 text-2xl\">Pievieno sākuma ekrānam</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/65\">Atver šo lapu telefonā un izvēlies „Pievienot sākuma ekrānam” — navigācija atvērsies kā lietotne ar vienu pieskārienu. Ekrāns braukšanas laikā neizslēgsies.</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-white/45\">Radaru dati: CSDD, Valsts policija, OpenStreetMap. Maršruti: FOSSGIS OSRM. Karte: OpenFreeMap © OpenStreetMap līdzautori. Informācija uzziņai — vienmēr ievēro ceļa zīmes un satiksmes noteikumus.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pb-6 sm:px-6\"><h2 class=\"display-md text-2xl text-ink\">Biežāk uzdotie jautājumi</h2><div class=\"mt-5 divide-y divide-line overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card\"><details class=\"group p-5\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-ink\">Vai navigācija ir bez maksas?</summary><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2\">Jā. Tavs Auto navigācija ir pilnīgi bezmaksas, bez reģistrācijas un bez lietotnes lejupielādes — tā darbojas tavā telefona pārlūkā.</p></details><details class=\"group p-5\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-ink\">Kuri radari ir redzami maršrutā?</summary><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2\">Visi stacionārie fotoradari (CSDD), vidējā ātruma kontroles posmi un Valsts policijas publicētās pārvietojamo fotoradaru iespējamās vietas, kas atrodas tieši uz izvēlētā maršruta.</p></details><details class=\"group p-5\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-ink\">Vai navigācija strādā bez interneta?</summary><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2\">Kartei un maršrutam vajadzīgs mobilais internets. Datu patēriņš ir neliels — līdzīgs citām navigācijas lietotnēm.</p></details><details class=\"group p-5\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-ink\">Vai tiek saglabāta mana atrašanās vieta?</summary><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2\">Nē. Atrašanās vieta tiek izmantota tavā ierīcē. Maršruta aprēķinam sākuma un galamērķa koordinātas tiek nosūtītas bezmaksas maršrutēšanas servisam, bet netiek saglabātas pie mums.</p></details></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-24 bg-night text-white/80\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr_1fr_1.2fr]\"><div><img src=\"/logo-tavs-auto-white.png\" alt=\"Tavs Auto\" width=\"461\" height=\"123\" class=\"h-9 w-auto sm:h-10\"/><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60\">Pārbaudīti lietoti auto no Eiropas ar līzingu visiem — arī ar sabojātu kredītvēsturi un ārzemēs strādājošajiem.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex gap-2\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/lizingsauto.lv/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"rounded-lg bg-white/10 p-2.5 hover:bg-white/20\" aria-label=\"Facebook\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.5 21v-7.5h2.5l.4-3h-2.9V8.6c0-.9.3-1.5 1.5-1.5h1.5V4.4c-.3 0-1.2-.1-2.2-.1-2.2 0-3.7 1.3-3.7 3.8v2.4H8v3h2.5V21h3z\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lizingsauto.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"rounded-lg bg-white/10 p-2.5 hover:bg-white/20\" aria-label=\"Instagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" class=\"h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"5\"></rect><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></a></div><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"text-xs text-white/50 hover:text-white\" href